  "text": " Global \n Distributor\n Europe\n\n \nProducts\nSolution\nConstruction Sites\nService & Support\nNews\nAbout Shantui\n\nFunction Navigation\nFind Dealer\n\nProduct Center\n\nContact Us\n\nRelated Links\nAfrica\nMiddle East Region\nSoutheast Asia\nEurasia\nAmerica\nDistributor\nInquiry\nContact Us\nSERVICE SUPPORT\n  Service & Support  Service Support\nSHANTUI SERVICE - ANYTIME & ANYWHERE\n\nShantui has set up 13 service centers, 4 special service stations, 114 agents, 265 service outlets, 100 Shantui service personnel, 1,346 agent service personnel and 660 service vehicles around the world.\n\n13\n13 Service Centers\n265\n265 Service Outlets\n1446\n1446 Service Personnel\n660\n660 Service Vehicles\nVALUE THAT WORKS\nClick To Learn More About Overseas Branch Layout\n READ MORE\nTHE UNIFORM PLATFORM IS ACCESSIBLE FROM MULTIPLE TERMINALS\nThe service process is visibly tracked and scheduled.\nMaintenance History\nOnline real-time view of repair and maintenance record\nAttentive Service\nprovide all-round 24/7 service for large projects and strategic products.\nCluster Management\nReal-time possessing of cluster status (equipment location, working status and fuel oil warning)\nMaintenance Service\nOn-site maintenance service to ensure equipment operating rate.\nProduct Improvement\nProduct suggestions can be submitted at any time and reach the marketing engineers with one click\nGlobal Training\nShantui service experts provide online and on-site training on product performance and maintenance skills\nMaintenance History\nOnline real-time view of repair and maintenance record\nAttentive Service\nprovide all-round 24/7 service for large projects and strategic products.\nCover 180 Countries\nProvide Solutions\nWithin 24 Hours\nSolve Problems\nWithin 72 Hours\nSearch | Contact Us | Privacy\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n© 2025 Shantui Construction Machinery co.,Ltd All Right Reserved\nJEREI Digital | Producing and Maintaining",
